    {
      "id": "p0137-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Defeating Dogamy and Dogaressa in battle will cause a bear in Snowdin to wonder where they went. In English, the bear says:",
        "raw": "Defeating Dogamy and Dogaressa in battle will cause a bear in Snowdin to\nwonder where they went. In English, the bear says:",
