    {
      "id": "p0137-b008",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "People: 人 (nin). Small animals: 匹 (hiki). Large animals: 頭 (tō). Butterflies, for some reason: 頭 (tō). Cylindrical objects: 本 (hon). Flat objects: 枚 (mai).",
        "raw": "People are counted with A (nin)\nSmall animals are counted with ~ (hiki)\nLarge animals are counted with l@! (to)\nButterflies are also counted with fl] (t*o) for some reason\nCylindrical objects are counted with (hon)\nFlat things are counted with t:z (mai)",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
